## 10. What NOT To Do

- Do not modify anything under `vendor/hcs/`. Wrap it in `src/`.
- Do not shell out to `paq8px.exe`, `upx`, `advancecomp`, `packJPG`, `lzo`,
  or any other GPL/LGPL tool. They are excluded from ziptastic entirely.
- Do not invent a new entropy coder from scratch. Use rANS + Huffman as specified.
- Do not skip Phase 1 (LZMA2 fallback). Without it, the Tier-1 guarantee fails.
- Do not proceed past a phase whose exit test fails — report the failure and wait.
- Do not add network-dependent features, model downloads, or GPU paths.
- Do not commit build artifacts. `build/` is git-ignored.

